{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在高兴过后开始害怕失去，特别想得到一份不会改变的保证，却知道没人能承诺永远。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、怕失去、渴望确定、隐隐心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"对方可能有一天不再需要他，所以他想把已经露出的喜欢藏回去；以及他其实已经无法装作不在乎，往回藏反而更难受。这两层需要读中下部的长句才能明白。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在幸福之后越来越怕失去对方，想要确定的承诺，又开始担心自己有一天会变得不再被需要。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"患得患失、焦虑、舍不得、悲伤\",\n      \"missed\": \"他具体想通过收回喜欢来减少未来的伤害，以及他已经真心投入、实际上无法再退回最初的不在乎。两组短语里的「胸口一沉再沉」「这一刻留不住」「像一声叹息」也需要逐条看。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他明明很珍惜眼前的幸福，却开始害怕对方不再需要自己，想藏起喜欢，又发现自己根本藏不回去了。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怕失去、眷恋、矛盾、幸福中的疼痛\",\n      \"missed\": \"他最初是怕给对方添负担，而现在害怕的是亲近关系消失；以及刚才对对方好是真心的，不是装出来的。这些因果和变化需要读完整段才能抓住。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三段同等醒目的长句同时争夺注意力，下面又有两组数量较多的短语，缺少一个明确的第一视觉入口。一眼能抓到「幸福之后开始怕失去」，但不容易马上拼出「害怕不再被需要—想把喜欢藏起来—发现自己已经藏不回去」的完整变化。短语整体与人物情绪有关，右侧时间线也提供了故事顺序，因此基本串得起来；但个别短语的归属不够直接，下方金色音符动画也主要表现音乐节奏，没有明确对应人物处境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5d878498-c7ae-4c89-a1e9-3e0ea2ac1718", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003204340215Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.968, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:33:15.314053+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "051566a0f64f86c97a5416d547c903ba907f8187d417d9b947784e0407e6a144", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003204340215Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "92a7aa58c8e9b4a48d6375ef041d5202fa42fa8090ddc89736aedf49dd6e7ded"}}}
